OL,4,CThousands oppose huge #10bn data centre
OL,5,GThousands of people have signed a      
OL,6,Gpetition opposing plans for a #10bn    
OL,7,Gdata centre close to a town.           
OL,9,FDeveloper Tract wants to build the 13- 
OL,10,Fbuilding giant, which will be called   
OL,11,FStockton-on-Tees Technology Park, on   
OL,12,Ffields to the west of the Teesside     
OL,13,Ftown.                                  
OL,15,FStockton's Conservative MP Matt        
OL,16,FVickers started the petition, which he 
OL,17,Fsaid had so far gathered 4,000         
OL,18,Fsignatures, opposing the plan and      
OL,19,Fcalled on Tract to build the plant on  
OL,20,Fbrownfield land.                       
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
