OL,4,CNursery fees to increase six months    
OL,5,Cbefore closure                         
OL,6,GParents have said they are "confused   
OL,7,Gand insulted" as fees at 10 publicly   
OL,8,Grun nurseries due to close in July     
OL,9,Gwill increase by 4%.                   
OL,11,FThe plan to axe South Tyneside         
OL,12,FAccredited Network for Learning in the 
OL,13,FEarly Years (STANLEYs) by July next    
OL,14,Fyear was confirmed on 23 September,    
OL,15,Fdespite protests by parents and staff. 
OL,17,FSouth Tyneside Council said the        
OL,18,Fcharges were part of a standard annual 
OL,19,Fuplift to local authority fees and     
OL,20,Fcharges from February 1, 2027.         
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
